{
  "about": "Made-up test vectors for the Rivr-Signature header. Every secret, id and body in this file is invented and used nowhere else.",
  "header": "Rivr-Signature: t=<unix seconds>,v1=<hex>[,v1=<hex>...]  (one v1 per active signing key)",
  "algorithm": "v1 = lowercase hex of HMAC-SHA256(key: the UTF-8 bytes of the whole secret, whsec_ included; message: the UTF-8 bytes of \"<t>.<raw body>\")",
  "toleranceSeconds": 300,
  "howToUse": "For every vector, verify(headers[\"Rivr-Signature\"] (absent means missing), body, secrets, now) must return valid. \"signing\" says how Rivr made the header; you do not need it to verify.",
